Model weights:
- KERAFound-MAE-OCT and KERAFound-MAE-Placido are continued pretraining of the ImageNet MAE ViT-L/16 weights
  (CC BY-NC 4.0) and are released under CC BY-NC 4.0.
- KERAFound-DINOv3-OCT, KERAFound-DINOv3-Placido and KERAFound-DINOv3-Photo are derivative works of Meta's DINOv3
  ViT-L/16 (LVD-1689M) weights and are distributed under the DINOv3 License; a copy is provided in LICENSE_DINOv3.md.
  Built with DINOv3.

The models are research tools. They are not medical devices and must not be used for clinical decision-making.
